  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- Sub-Symbol              is one of the following \n  multipliers: X2,
      X3 or X4.\n- Sub-Symbol              can appear with any symbols \n  except
      Wild.\n- If Symbols with Sub-Symbols              are part of win \n  line(s),
      then the Sub-Symbols              get multiplied\n  to each other and applied
      to the win(s)."
